 "script": "Turkey's done. Now the grease. Straight down the sink!\n\nWait. Why is the sink gurgling?\n\nBlurp! It came right back up. On me.\n\nHere's the thing. Grease causes almost half of reported sewer blockages. Forty-seven percent, says the EPA.\n\nSo after the feast, do this.\n\nOne. Let the grease cool, pour it in a can, and toss it in the trash.\n\nTwo. Wipe the pan with a paper towel before you wash it.\n\nThree. Slow drain? Hot water and dish soap, then a plunger. And never mix drain cleaners.\n\nIf Homie can fix it, so can you.",
